    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING: Undercroft features some flashing lights that might trigger anyone with epilepsy. Please be aware and keep yourself safe.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Undercroft is a short, atmospheric, puzzle filled top down shooter inspired by games like <i>Outer Wilds</i> and <i>Tunic</i>.</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859360/extras/bc9ab0dd209002e406f719b909f38567.poster.avif?t=1746721870\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859360/extras/bc9ab0dd209002e406f719b909f38567.webm?t=1746721870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859360/extras/bc9ab0dd209002e406f719b909f38567.mp4?t=1746721870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A ghost town in the middle of nowhere hides a dark secret under its church, a sprawling crypt filled with ancient secrets and a past that doesn't want to be found. You are hired to clean it out of any living things you find in the dark caverns.<br><br>Fight powerful monsters and bosses as you explore the crypts. Solve cryptic puzzles that will require your full attention. The only thing gating your progress is the knowledge you gain of this world.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING: Undercroft features some flashing lights that might trigger anyone with epilepsy. Please be aware and keep yourself safe.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Undercroft is a short, atmospheric, puzzle filled top down shooter inspired by games like <i>Outer Wilds</i> and <i>Tunic</i>.</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859360/extras/bc9ab0dd209002e406f719b909f38567.poster.avif?t=1746721870\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859360/extras/bc9ab0dd209002e406f719b909f38567.webm?t=1746721870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859360/extras/bc9ab0dd209002e406f719b909f38567.mp4?t=1746721870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A ghost town in the middle of nowhere hides a dark secret under its church, a sprawling crypt filled with ancient secrets and a past that doesn't want to be found. You are hired to clean it out of any living things you find in the dark caverns.<br><br>Fight powerful monsters and bosses as you explore the crypts. Solve cryptic puzzles that will require your full attention. The only thing gating your progress is the knowledge you gain of this world.",
    "short_description": "Under the old forgotten church lies a sprawling crypt, filled with lost histories and abandoned secrets. Search through the forgotten catacombs and uncover the mystery behind it's creation. Maybe you can find out how to save yourself along the way.",
